Package: bhb-worker
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: BlackHatBadshah <contact@blackhatbadshah.com>
Description: BHB Worker - Log streaming and system monitoring agent
 A background service that streams logs and system metrics to the BHB platform.
 Features include log tailing, CPU/memory/disk/network monitoring, and
 process management via SignalR.
Depends: libc6
